description: >-
  Combines "excludes weekends" with "weekend friday" (redefining the
  weekend start day to Friday) using the YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss dateFormat
  with time-of-day timestamps.
---
gantt
  dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss
  excludes    weekends
  weekend friday
